{"id": "34522", "title": "爱女生ㄋㄟ", "author": "陈毓华", "category": "文学名著", "count": 46, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34522.htm", "intro": "一别九年，当初离家出走的少年郎又回来喽！不再是可怜兮兮的被收容，他以事业有成的贵公子住下，准备拿「死守四行仓库」的战斗精神，卯起来追当年就爱的漂漂小女生，丰胸乳膏是久别重逢的第一件小礼，并非他爱海咪咪，而是她真的需要咩，拒收？ㄟ、呃……好，小而美他也爱！不过爱就是要让她习惯他的喜好，「陪看」这回事变得很重要，管他是购物频道还是锁码台，瘫在电视机前陪他看就对了，只是她怎么会看出那种后遗症啊……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34522", "chapters": [{"title": "序言", "file": "2190231.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2190232.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2190233.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2190234.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2190235.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2190236.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2190237.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2190238.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2190239.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2190240.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2190241.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2190242.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2190243.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2190244.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2190245.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2190246.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2190247.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2190248.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2190249.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2190250.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2190251.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2190252.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2190253.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2190254.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2190255.html", "available": false},